web/src/app/qr.ts, the QR code encoder of Settings → Add a device, follows
the structure of Project Nayuki's QR Code generator library
(https://www.nayuki.io/page/qr-code-generator-library): its Reed-Solomon
divisor and remainder, its format, version and alignment layout, its codeword
placement, its block interleaving and its mask penalty. It is cut down to byte
mode and error correction level M, written for this repository, and checked
against the vectors of ISO/IEC 18004.

